<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's olive oil output 250,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's olive oil output 250,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading olive oil exporter Tunisia on Friday said that its output during the production season running from last November to March was 250,000 tonnes, up from 60,000 tonnes the previous season.</p>
<p>Export value is expected to reach 264 million dinars ($239 million), Agriculture Ministry reports showed.</p>
<p>Since the start of the season in November and as of the end of April, Tunisia exported 39,000 tonnes of olive oil worth 105 million dinars, Agriculture Minister Mabrouk Bahri told journalists on Friday. There were no olive oil exports during the same period the previous season. ($=1.1024 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
